              "content": "Common questions before you deploy Gameplane to your cluster.",
              "fontFamily": "$typography/font-sans",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "d9OBmF",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "jfw6L",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "EDHQA",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "Do I need to know Kubernetes?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "One-time cluster setup benefits from basic Helm familiarity. Day-to-day server management — console, files, backups, players — is entirely dashboard-driven; kubectl is optional."
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "z5EQrQ",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "Is Gameplane production-ready?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "It's a pre-v1 release (v0.4.0). Core workflows are feature-complete and tested, but not yet recommended for unattended production — see the Roadmap."
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "fUD5W",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "Is it free?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "Yes. Gameplane is open-source under AGPL-3.0-or-later, with no paid tiers."
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "U5LykJ",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "ZHWO8",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "What happens to my data if I uninstall?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "Depends on your cluster's StorageClass reclaim policy — Gameplane doesn't force-delete PVCs itself. Back up critical data before uninstalling."
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "tzhXW",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "What database does it use?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "SQLite by default and is the production-tested driver. The PostgreSQL driver works end to end but is experimental: it needs an API image built with the `postgres` build tag, and the API must stay a single replica."
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "QtM65",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "Can I manage servers without the dashboard?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "Yes. Advanced users can bypass the API entirely and manage everything with kubectl apply — the operator is authoritative, so both stay in sync."
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "tLPlD",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "v9zjax",
                      "name": "FAQ Item Dashboard Cluster",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "descendants": {
                        "C2FCOL": {
                          "icon": "circle-help"
                        },
                        "XvFxz": {
                          "content": "Do I need a Kubernetes cluster to run the dashboard?"
                        },
                        "tne6e": {
                          "content": "Not for the panel itself since v0.4.0. Docker Compose or a standalone Helm profile runs the API and dashboard without Kubernetes; games still run on registered clusters, each with its own operator and agents."
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
